<description>&lt;p&gt;Boko Haram fighters attacked a Cameroonian village, killing seven people, while government forces continue operations against Anglophone separatists in the Northwest and Southwest. A metal shark patrol boat has been delivered to Cameroon to enhance maritime security against Boko Haram. An explosion at a steel plant killed four people and injured sixteen. Anti-femicide protests have taken place, reflecting broader social tensions. The conflict recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPLW93ZFRQNG1CektwTG1UVEVMdDRRbmRQNVUwWlQyUHFkVVpRVHhwZ19DQlZRZW1JT3dhbllFZi1fMXA5a1FxSVc0U25XOENXNy1KOUI2T05iWHBXY2V6MkFCWGVOaU5nT3I4eklpTVd5cXlyRGRUQ3BZQllzV01XZW1jRU5LWGtHUTgwd3Q4QTNVNVV4dEc2SGdB?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxONVFLNEdKX21pc0hWWlJ6aDYwMFJSdC1Tbm9EMGRmYWR1RUg3NU9rdlRUR01oOGtEelQ0Uk5ZamY0QXpFWmctZ245LWZRbm1tcFlfdDNrcnlqY1BzNE5HbFdIdlY0NDFuQUg1SnNPQWQ5UVp0YWJXaHg2OGVwb2lubw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Albert Lea Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxPOGRGWmRXQVYyZHBnQnM4WjRqR3VkZjBUd0JYNzdGdnlyd2tqV1BBeV8tNk5najdfWUhvQWlFZ3ppSzR4TjNocUliR2lmOEJBMHVhOVZ6Vm9CdmhxaGMza2pYejk5Z1FNM1RXelBCeUgxWWUtZVQxUzNZX09NRUxVdldMdUFla2ppUEhyN0hUYU8teGV6akphdXVfMFRXZ1NSTzllLWhIX0l2SVE4UG0wYmpWbHloRi0ySkM2dVI4V21wNWFFbEVV?oc=5&quot;&gt;KSAT&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQaG1rSldjbDZTYmJJYXhhb2llaWZSbHNPZVZTVUxjaUlHOXFXcmphdC1FQmVJbXJDV3dWVkp6dHIwdVRUOXVaV3NPWmR2cmZKODdzd2ZJWW9vc1RSUkczNnozU21Fb2NUT1ZuekhGRXpMYms0YnVULVczaGtrLVRLc3ZGeTNOS1pHdFoxMUNDa3h2SEUzUnBLektQSVRzRlRyb1g4WHQxM3JabGpkeHZBRUk5UnhuYlBLc0hiYQ?oc=5&quot;&